from root_resilience_author import *
U=[]
U.append(unit('密度差與理想淡鹹水界面~Density contrast and an ideal fresh-saline interface',
'淡地下水與海水密度不同，在理想靜水平衡下會形成淡水位高出海面的高度與界面深度之間的關係。這個尖銳界面模型把混合帶壓縮成一條線，並忽略地下水流動、分層和抽水引起的局部上升，因此適合理解密度效應，不能直接定位現地鹽水前緣。地下水屏障利用補注改變水頭與流向，不是一道實體不透水牆。實際評估需要同時觀察不同深度的壓力、鹽度和時間變化，不能只在單一水井量到高水位就認定所有含水層已受到保護。~Fresh groundwater and seawater have different densities. Ideal hydrostatic equilibrium relates freshwater elevation above sea level to interface depth below it. The sharp-interface approximation compresses a mixing zone into a line and omits flow, layering and local pumping-induced upconing, making it useful for understanding density effects rather than locating a field salt front. Recharge barriers alter heads and flow paths rather than forming impermeable walls. Assess pressure, salinity and temporal behavior at multiple depths instead of inferring protection from one high well level.',
'教學假設靜水、均質非受壓含水層及尖銳界面，淡水密度1000、鹹水1025 kg/m³，淡水位高出海面0.80 m；z=1000×0.80/(1025−1000)=32 m，為海面以下的理想界面深度。~Assume hydrostatic equilibrium, a homogeneous unconfined aquifer and sharp interface, with densities 1000 and 1025 kg/m³ and freshwater head 0.80 m above sea level. Interface depth below sea level is 32 m.',
'先以相同海面基準畫出兩側壓力柱，確認界面兩側壓力相等，再檢查密度和深度單位。比較分層鹽度剖面時，記錄混合帶厚度及採樣深度，將理想界面與實測過渡區分開呈現，不把一條計算線包裝成精確地質邊界。~Draw pressure columns using one sea-level datum and verify pressure continuity before checking density and depth units. Compare depth-resolved salinity observations, recording mixing-zone thickness and sampling depth, and distinguish the ideal interface from the observed transition zone rather than presenting a calculated line as an exact geological boundary.',
'把四十倍比例當成任何海岸都固定成立的法則，會忽略密度、地層與流動的差異。抽水井附近可能出現局部鹽水上升，遠處水位看似足夠仍不能證明井口水質穩定。~Treating a forty-to-one ratio as universal ignores density, stratigraphy and flow. Local saltwater upconing near pumping wells may occur even when distant heads appear adequate, so a regional head measurement does not demonstrate stable production-water quality.',
'任何海岸含水層只要水位高出海面一公尺，實際鹽水界面就必定精確位於四十公尺深。~Every coastal aquifer with one metre of freshwater head has an actual interface exactly forty metres deep.',
'保持淡水位不變，將鹹水密度改為1020 kg/m³並重算深度，再畫出有厚混合帶的剖面。說明哪個結果只是尖銳界面模型的預測，另列出需要補充的壓力與鹽度量測，避免把簡式直接當作場址設計。~Hold freshwater head fixed, change saline density to 1020 kg/m³ and recalculate depth. Sketch a finite mixing zone, identify what the sharp-interface approximation predicts, and list additional pressure and salinity observations needed before any site-specific interpretation.'))
U.append(unit('等效淡水水頭與壓力基準~Equivalent freshwater head and pressure datum',
'井內水柱的密度會影響水位與壓力的換算，相同水面高程不一定表示相同的等效淡水水頭。使用壓力感測器時，必須清楚定義量測點高程、表壓或絕對壓以及參考密度，再把不同井的資料轉成一致表示方式。等效淡水水頭有助於比較壓力，但在密度隨位置改變時，不能把其梯度直接當成所有方向上的流速，尤其垂直方向還包含密度驅動項。海岸監測因此需要溫度和鹽度資料配合，讓壓力變化與密度變化能被分辨。~Water-column density affects conversion between pressure and level, so equal surface elevations need not imply equal equivalent freshwater heads. Define sensor elevation, gauge versus absolute pressure and reference density before comparing wells. Equivalent freshwater head provides a common pressure representation, but with spatially variable density its gradient alone does not describe flow in every direction; vertical flow includes an additional density effect. Coastal monitoring therefore needs temperature and salinity observations to distinguish pressure changes from changes in fluid density.',
'教學量測點高程z=−20 m，表壓p=201105 Pa，參考淡水密度1000 kg/m³；h_f=z+p/(1000×9.81)=0.50 m。此壓力也等於密度1025 kg/m³、20 m鹹水柱的壓力。~For sensor elevation −20 m and gauge pressure 201105 Pa, freshwater-equivalent head is −20+201105/(1000×9.81)=0.50 m. The pressure also equals that of a 20 m saline column at 1025 kg/m³.',
'為每支感測器列出高程基準、壓力類型與密度來源，先扣除適當大氣壓再進行換算。用同一支儀器的人工水位與鹽度紀錄交叉檢查，對密度未知的時段標示不確定度，不能把資料缺口當成淡水條件。~Record elevation datum, pressure type and density provenance for each instrument, applying the appropriate atmospheric correction. Cross-check against manual levels and salinity records, and flag uncertainty when density is unknown rather than silently assuming freshwater throughout a missing-data interval.',
'將絕對壓直接當表壓，會加入一整個大氣壓的偏差；將不同鹽度井的水面高程直接相減，則可能把密度差誤認為補注形成的梯度。兩種錯誤都可能改變對屏障成效的判斷。~Using absolute pressure as gauge pressure adds an atmospheric offset. Directly subtracting levels from wells with different salinities can mistake density effects for recharge gradients; either error can distort conclusions about barrier performance.',
'只要兩口井的水面高程相同，不論井內水的密度如何，壓力狀態就完全相同。~Equal water-surface elevations imply identical pressure conditions regardless of fluid density.',
'建立淡水與鹹水兩根相同高度的虛擬水柱，分別計算底部表壓與等效淡水水頭。再加入一個不同高程的感測點，說明為何比較之前必須統一基準、壓力類型與密度，而非只比較畫面上的水位數字。~Create equal-height virtual fresh and saline water columns and calculate bottom gauge pressure and equivalent freshwater head. Add a sensor at another elevation and explain why datum, pressure type and density must be reconciled before comparing displayed levels.'))
U.append(unit('達西通量與孔隙流速~Darcy flux and pore-water velocity',
'屏障改變水力梯度後，穿越含水層截面的流量可先用達西定律估算，但這個流量除以總截面積得到的是達西通量，不是水在孔隙中的平均前進速度。連通有效孔隙率決定可供流動的面積比例，使用總孔隙率或岩心小樣本值時都要注意代表性。此簡式假設單相、近似定密度、層流和可代表的水力傳導係數；若含水層有高導水通道，平均速度無法描述最快污染路徑。教學上應先分清流量、通量及速度，再討論旅行時間。~A changed hydraulic gradient can be translated into section flow using Darcy law, but discharge divided by total section area is Darcy flux rather than average pore-water velocity. Connected effective porosity determines the flowing fraction, and total porosity or a small core measurement may not represent it. The approximation assumes single-phase, approximately constant-density laminar flow and representative conductivity. Preferential pathways can move solute faster than the average, so distinguish discharge, flux and velocity before interpreting travel time.',
'教學假設K=20 m/day、梯度i=0.002、截面積A=500 m²及有效孔隙率0.25；Q=KiA=20 m³/day，達西通量0.04 m/day，平均孔隙流速0.04/0.25=0.16 m/day。~Assume conductivity 20 m/day, gradient 0.002, section area 500 m² and effective porosity 0.25. Discharge is 20 m³/day, Darcy flux 0.04 m/day and average pore-water velocity 0.16 m/day.',
'逐項標註量綱，檢查梯度是同基準水頭差除以距離，且截面方向與主要流向一致。以不同尺度的水力試驗和示蹤觀察比較有效參數，對只由單一岩心推估的速度另列限制，不把計算精度誤當現地參數精度。~Label dimensions and confirm that gradient uses consistent head datums and distance, with area normal to flow. Compare hydraulic tests and tracer observations across scales, documenting limitations of core-derived parameters rather than confusing numerical precision with confidence in field conductivity or effective porosity.',
'把流量除以總面積得到的值直接當成孔隙速度，會低估理想平均前進速度。相反地，把有效孔隙率用得過小也會高估速度；通道效應則可能使兩種平均估算都無法描述最早到達。~Treating discharge per total area as pore velocity understates ideal average movement. An unrealistically small effective porosity overstates it, while preferential pathways can make either average insufficient for predicting earliest arrival at a monitoring point.',
'達西通量與孔隙中的平均水流速度永遠相同，不需要知道有效孔隙率。~Darcy flux always equals average pore-water velocity without any need for effective porosity.',
'保持流量與截面不變，將有效孔隙率從0.25改為0.20，重算平均速度。再畫出一條高導水狹窄通道，解釋為何相同總流量可能產生不同的到達時間分布，並列出可辨識這種差異的觀測方式。~Keep discharge and section fixed while lowering effective porosity from 0.25 to 0.20. Recalculate velocity, sketch a narrow preferential pathway and explain why equal total discharge can produce different arrival-time distributions and require additional observations.'))
U.append(unit('理想徑向注入與水頭隆起~Ideal radial injection and head buildup',
'在均質受壓含水層中，定常注入的水頭增量可由徑向流動近似理解，離注入位置越近，理想增量通常越大。公式中的外邊界不是任意選來配合答案的半徑，而是明確設定的定水頭邊界。穿透不完全、井皮效應、分層與密度差都會使現地反應偏離簡式；注入井內的壓力也不等於遠處含水層的水頭。因此本課僅用理想模型理解參數敏感度，不推導現場注入壓力設定或以單一井的反應取代監測網。~In a homogeneous confined aquifer, steady radial flow explains how head buildup varies with distance from injection. The outer radius represents a specified constant-head boundary, not an arbitrary tuning distance. Partial penetration, well skin, layering and density contrast can invalidate the approximation, and pressure inside an injection well differs from aquifer head away from it. Use this ideal model for parameter sensitivity rather than prescribing operating pressure or substituting one well response for a distributed monitoring network.',
'教學假設完全穿透、定常徑向流、T=100 m²/day、Q=500 m³/day，外定水頭半徑R=200 m；在r=10 m處Δh=Q ln(R/r)/(2πT)=2.384 m，忽略井損與密度差。~Assume fully penetrating steady radial injection, transmissivity 100 m²/day and discharge 500 m³/day, with constant-head radius 200 m. At radius 10 m, buildup is 500 ln(20)/(2π×100)=2.384 m, excluding well losses and density effects.',
'先在圖上標出外邊界和計算點，確認使用自然對數且半徑比無量綱。將不同距離的增量畫成對數距離圖，再與觀測井而非注入井內壓力比較，若斜率或邊界反應不符，應重新檢查含水層與時間假設。~Mark the outer boundary and evaluation point, checking natural logarithms and a dimensionless radius ratio. Plot buildup against logarithmic distance and compare observation-well responses, not just injection-well pressure, revisiting aquifer and steady-state assumptions when the slope or boundary response differs.',
'忽略井損而把注入井壓力全算成含水層水頭，會高估屏障向外延伸的效果。尚未達定常時套用固定外邊界，也可能把時間造成的差異錯誤解讀成傳導係數改變。~Assigning all injection-well pressure to aquifer buildup overstates the barrier effect away from the well. Applying a fixed steady boundary before stabilization can likewise mistake time-dependent behavior for a change in aquifer transmissivity.',
'注入井內壓力升高多少，周圍所有觀測井的含水層水頭就必然同步升高多少。~An injection-well pressure increase must appear unchanged at every surrounding observation well.',
'將傳導係數加倍而保持注入量及邊界不變，重算水頭增量並畫出兩條理想剖面。接著加入一個只影響井內的假設井損，說明為何井壓上升不一定代表遠處屏障變強，並指出需要比較的量測位置。~Double transmissivity while keeping injection and boundaries fixed, then compare ideal profiles. Add a hypothetical loss affecting only the injection well and explain why rising well pressure need not strengthen the distant barrier, identifying the observation locations required to distinguish both effects.'))
U.append(unit('線性疊加與井間薄弱區~Linear superposition and gaps between wells',
'在參數固定且控制方程線性的模型中，各注入源造成的水頭增量可以相加，但疊加的是同一基準下的增量，不是絕對水頭重複相加。井間位置可能比井邊的水頭低，因此屏障是否連續需要沿線剖面和深度分層來判讀。若飽和厚度顯著改變、密度耦合或井損非線性，簡單疊加便可能不適用。教學上應把背景水頭、各源增量與總水頭分開，讓學徒看出局部高值不能取代整條防護線的證據。~When parameters are fixed and governing equations are linear, head increments from individual sources may be added. Add increments on one datum rather than repeatedly adding absolute heads. Interwell locations can have lower heads than locations near wells, so barrier continuity requires along-line and depth-resolved assessment. Changing saturated thickness, density coupling or nonlinear well losses may invalidate simple superposition. Separate background head, source increments and total head to show why a local maximum cannot establish protection along the entire barrier.',
'教學假設同一受壓線性模型、相同外邊界及固定參數，某點由兩注入源各產生1.5 m與1.0 m增量；合成增量2.5 m。背景水頭0.4 m時，總水頭2.9 m，而非把背景算兩次。~For one linear confined model with fixed properties and common boundaries, two sources add 1.5 and 1.0 m at a point. Total buildup is 2.5 m; adding background head 0.4 m once gives total head 2.9 m.',
'用單源與雙源模型在相同網格上比較水頭增量，檢查差值是否符合線性疊加。沿井間中線及不同深度列出最低值，並核對背景水頭是否只加入一次；對參數隨水頭改變的模型，另做完整聯合運算而非強行相加。~Compare single-source and combined increments on the same grid to test linearity. Examine interwell minima at multiple depths and verify that background head is added only once. When properties vary with head, use a combined calculation rather than forcing a linear sum onto a nonlinear system.',
'只查看每口注入井旁的高水頭，可能漏掉井間或較深層的薄弱位置。將絕對水頭相加又會重複背景值，造成整條屏障似乎比實際更高，進一步掩蓋監測配置不足。~Checking only high heads beside injection wells can miss weaker interwell or deeper locations. Adding absolute heads double-counts the background and exaggerates apparent protection, potentially concealing the need for a better distributed monitoring network.',
'兩個注入源各自造成的絕對水頭可以直接相加，不必扣除重複的背景水頭。~Absolute heads from two injection sources can be added directly without removing duplicated background head.',
'建立五個沿線節點，分別給定兩源增量和同一背景水頭，算出總水頭並找最小值。將其中一源的流量降低一半，在線性假設下重算，再說明若含水層厚度同時改變，為何需要重新檢驗疊加條件。~Create five along-line nodes with increments from two sources and one background head. Find the minimum total head, halve one source under linear assumptions, and explain why a simultaneous change in saturated thickness requires checking the superposition assumptions again.'))
U.append(unit('保守離子與兩端元混合~Conservative ions and two-endmember mixing',
'鹽度變化可以用保守溶質的兩端元混合先作概念估算，但必須確定淡水與海水端元濃度具有代表性，且沒有其他溶質來源、反應或顯著體積非加成。氯離子常被用來追蹤鹹水影響，卻也可能來自其他來源；一個濃度值不能獨自證明海水入侵。監測應結合離子比例、地層、時間序列與水力資訊，並明確區分混合比例、海水前緣位置和水質用途判斷，三者不是同一個計算問題。~Two-endmember conservative-solute mixing provides a conceptual estimate of saline contribution when freshwater and seawater concentrations are representative and other sources, reactions and volume nonadditivity are negligible. Chloride can trace saline influence but may have other origins, so one concentration does not independently demonstrate seawater intrusion. Combine ion ratios, stratigraphy, time series and hydraulic evidence. Distinguish mixing fraction from salt-front location and end-use water quality, because these are separate questions requiring different evidence.',
'教學假設保守氯離子、體積可加，淡水50、海水19000、混合樣本240 mg/L；海水體積比例f=(240−50)/(19000−50)=0.010026，約1.003%。此值不代表用途合格或前緣位置。~Assume conservative chloride and additive volumes, with fresh, sea and mixed concentrations of 50, 19000 and 240 mg/L. Seawater volume fraction is (240−50)/(19000−50)=0.010026, about 1.003%, not a water-quality acceptance result or front location.',
'用質量守恆反代混合比例，檢查結果介於零與一之間，並將端元取樣日期和位置列入紀錄。再比較其他保守指標及水頭變化，若不同指標不能支持相同混合解釋，應調查額外來源或反應，而非只保留最符合預期的濃度。~Substitute the fraction into mass balance, check that it lies between zero and one, and record endmember sampling dates and locations. Compare other conservative indicators and head changes; disagreement should prompt investigation of additional sources or reactions rather than selective retention of the preferred concentration.',
'使用固定海水端元而忽略季節或河口淡化，會改變估算比例；若氯離子另有工業或地表來源，兩端元模型也可能把非海水污染誤認成海水混入，造成錯誤的成因判斷。~A fixed seawater endmember can misrepresent seasonal or estuarine dilution. Additional industrial or surface sources of chloride can be falsely assigned to seawater by a two-endmember model, producing an incorrect explanation of the observed concentration increase.',
'只要樣本氯離子升高，就能單獨證明海水入侵，且不需要檢查其他來源。~An increase in chloride alone proves seawater intrusion without checking any alternative source.',
'將淡水端元濃度提高到100 mg/L，保持樣本與海水端元不變，重算比例。再加入第三個高氯來源的概念圖，說明單一濃度為何無法唯一分解三個來源，並提出至少一項額外觀測以改善辨識。~Raise the freshwater endmember to 100 mg/L while retaining the other concentrations and recalculate the fraction. Add a third chloride source conceptually, explain why one concentration cannot uniquely separate three sources, and propose an additional observation that improves identification.'))
U.append(unit('注入能力衰減與成因辨識~Declining injectivity and causal diagnosis',
'注入能力常以流量除以相對背景的水頭增量描述，但指標下降不一定只有井周堵塞一種原因。區域水位升高、密度改變、量測位置差異或設備損失都可能改變分母，因此比較不同時間前應統一基準、流量區間與資料校正。堵塞也可能包含細粒、化學沉澱、生物膜與氣體效應，不能只用一個比值決定處理方式。課程以趨勢辨識為目的，要求先區分含水層反應和井內損失，再由具場址資料的人員評估原因。~Injectivity is commonly expressed as discharge divided by head buildup relative to background, but a decline does not uniquely diagnose clogging. Regional head changes, density, measurement location and equipment losses can alter the denominator, requiring consistent baselines, flow ranges and corrections. Clogging may involve particles, precipitation, biofilms or gas, and one ratio cannot select a remedy. Use the metric for trend detection, separating aquifer response from well losses before interpreting causes with site-specific evidence.',
'教學假設同一流量100 m³/day，經背景與密度校正後的增量由2 m升至10 m；注入能力由50降至10 m²/day，降低80%。這只是性能指標，不能據此直接提高現場注入壓力。~At the same 100 m³/day flow, corrected buildup increases from 2 to 10 m. Injectivity falls from 50 to 10 m²/day, an 80% decrease. This performance indicator does not justify increasing field injection pressure.',
'對比同一流量區間、相同感測位置及一致背景基準的歷史資料，同時查看鄰近觀測井與注入井內的反應。把儀器校正、停運期間和水質變化標在時間軸上，區分量測偏差、區域變化與局部性能衰減的可能證據。~Compare matching flow ranges, sensor locations and background datums while examining both injection and nearby observation wells. Mark calibration, shutdowns and source-water changes on the timeline to distinguish measurement bias, regional behavior and local performance deterioration using separate lines of evidence.',
'直接比較未校正的井內壓力，可能把區域水位升高誤認成堵塞。反過來，若只看流量仍達標而忽略所需水頭增加，可能錯失性能衰減的早期訊號，讓後續判讀更加困難。~Comparing uncorrected well pressures can mistake regional head rise for clogging. Conversely, observing unchanged discharge while ignoring increasing required head can miss early deterioration and leave later diagnosis dependent on incomplete historical records.',
'注入能力下降一定只代表細砂堵塞，因此不必檢查區域水位、密度或儀器校正。~Declining injectivity always means sand clogging, so regional head, density and calibration need no review.',
'建立兩份相同表面指標下降的合成紀錄，一份由背景水位變化造成，另一份由局部水頭損失增加造成。加入鄰近觀測井資料後重新計算，說明哪一項證據能區分兩種情境，以及哪些原因仍無法唯一確認。~Construct two synthetic records with equal apparent injectivity decline, one caused by background head change and the other by local loss. Add nearby observation data, recalculate the corrected metric and identify which evidence distinguishes the scenarios and which causes remain unresolved.'))
U.append(unit('壓力傳播與溶質旅行時間~Pressure propagation versus solute travel time',
'水頭訊號可以透過含水層的壓力擴散快速傳遞，而新注入水或溶質需要隨流動路徑前進，兩者的時間尺度常不同。觀測井很快出現水位反應，不代表補注水已到達或鹽水已被置換。壓力擴散的特徵時間取決於傳導係數與儲水係數，平流旅行時間則取決於孔隙速度和路徑長度；實際濃度曲線還受彌散和混合影響。解釋屏障監測時應把壓力、示蹤物與水質的證據分列，避免用快速訊號取代較慢的物質傳輸驗證。~Hydraulic signals can propagate through pressure diffusion much faster than injected water or solute moves along flow paths. A rapid well-level response does not demonstrate arrival of recharge water or displacement of salinity. Pressure timescales depend on transmissivity and storativity, whereas advective travel depends on pore velocity and path length; dispersion and mixing further shape concentration curves. Keep hydraulic, tracer and quality evidence separate so a fast pressure response is not substituted for slower verification of material transport.',
'教學假設距離100 m、孔隙速度0.20 m/day，平流時間500日。若T=100 m²/day、S=0.001，水力擴散率D=T/S=100000 m²/day，尺度L²/D=0.10日；後者不是精確到達時間。~For distance 100 m and pore velocity 0.20 m/day, advective travel is 500 days. With transmissivity 100 m²/day and storativity 0.001, hydraulic diffusivity is 100000 m²/day and L²/D is 0.10 day, a characteristic scale rather than exact arrival time.',
'分別繪製水頭與保守示蹤濃度的時間序列，統一時間基準但保留各自的採樣解析度。檢查壓力反應是否也可能由潮汐或抽水造成，再以濃度和其他水化學證據辨識水體到達，不把第一個水位變化點當成示蹤物到達點。~Plot head and conservative-tracer series on a common time basis while retaining their sampling resolutions. Check whether tides or pumping could explain the pressure response, then use concentration and supporting chemistry to assess water arrival instead of labeling the first head change as tracer breakthrough.',
'把快速水頭上升視為補注水已經到達，可能高估水質改善的速度。若示蹤物尚未量到就判定工程失效，也可能忽略較長旅行時間；兩種誤判都源於把壓力與物質傳輸混成同一過程。~Equating rapid head rise with recharge-water arrival can overstate the speed of quality improvement. Declaring failure before tracer arrival can instead ignore a longer travel time; both errors confuse pressure transmission with movement of water and solute.',
'觀測井一出現水位上升，就表示新注入水已經抵達該井，無需其他示蹤資料。~A water-level rise proves newly injected water has reached the well without any tracer evidence.',
'在同一張時間軸上標示兩種理想時間尺度，將孔隙速度降低一半再重算平流時間。另把儲水係數增加十倍，觀察壓力尺度如何改變，說明不同參數影響不同過程，不能用一個延遲係數同時校正所有資料。~Place both ideal timescales on one timeline, halve pore velocity and recalculate transport time. Increase storativity tenfold separately and compare the pressure scale, explaining why distinct processes respond to different parameters and cannot share one universal delay correction.'))
U.append(unit('分層分配與獨立含水層~Layer allocation and independent aquifers',
'多層含水層的補注分配取決於各層傳導能力、背景水頭與施加增量。即使總流量足夠，也可能主要進入較高傳導性的層位，讓其他層的防護不足。教學模型可把兩個彼此隔離、相同幾何的線性支路放在紙上比較，但不能據此設計跨層連通井，因為實際層間混流會改變水質與壓力邊界。分析應保留每層獨立的水量帳和監測資料，避免把全井平均反應當成各層反應一致的證據。~Recharge allocation across layers depends on transmissivity, background head and imposed buildup. Sufficient total flow may preferentially enter a conductive layer while another remains weakly supported. A teaching model can compare hydraulically isolated linear branches with equal geometry, but it does not justify cross-aquifer connections, which alter quality and pressure boundaries. Keep separate layer balances and monitoring evidence instead of treating an average well response as proof that every aquifer receives equal hydraulic protection.',
'教學假設兩個水力隔離支路，幾何、外邊界和施加增量相同，T分別100與50 m²/day；總Q=300 m³/day依傳導係數比例分為200與100 m³/day。僅為獨立支路線性模型。~For two hydraulically isolated branches with equal geometry, outer heads and applied buildup, transmissivities are 100 and 50 m²/day. A total 300 m³/day splits proportionally into 200 and 100 m³/day in this linear teaching model.',
'先檢查兩支路是否確實採相同邊界與幾何，再分別核對流量和水頭資料。以分層觀測而非全井平均濃度判讀防護效果，若背景水頭不同，需重新解各支路方程，不可仍用傳導係數比例硬分總流量。~Verify common geometry and boundary assumptions before comparing branch flows and heads. Assess protection with layer-specific observations rather than whole-well average concentration. If background heads differ, solve the branches separately instead of retaining a proportional split based only on transmissivity.',
'把總注入量平均除以層數，會忽略各層傳導能力不同。若高流量層的淡水掩蓋另一層鹽度升高，全井混合樣本可能看似穩定，卻無法揭示較弱層位的變化。~Dividing total injection equally among layers ignores differing transmissivity. Fresh water from a high-flow layer can mask rising salinity in another, so a stable mixed well sample may conceal important changes within a weaker layer.',
'只要總注入量足夠，每個含水層就一定會自動獲得相同流量與相同保護。~Adequate total injection automatically gives every aquifer equal flow and equal protection.',
'將第二支路的傳導係數降為25 m²/day，在相同線性邊界下重算分配。再只改其背景水頭，指出原本比例式哪個假設不再成立，並畫出應分層記錄的流量、水頭和鹽度欄位，不提出實體跨層接通方案。~Reduce the second branch transmissivity to 25 m²/day and recalculate the split under unchanged linear boundaries. Then change only its background head, identify the failed assumption and design separate flow, head and salinity records without proposing physical cross-aquifer connections.'))
U.append(unit('潮汐水頭衰減與相位延遲~Tidal-head attenuation and phase lag',
'海岸潮汐可使地下水壓力週期變化，離岸距離增加時振幅可能衰減並產生相位延遲。這種訊號提供水力參數的線索，但壓力潮汐並不等於鹽水隨每個週期同距離進退。理想一維受壓半無限含水層可以用擴散方程的週期解描述，實際上地層邊界、河道、抽水與大氣壓都可能疊加其他訊號。學徒應先理解振幅比和相位的量綱，再以多點資料檢查模型是否合理，而不是只用一口井擬合出漂亮曲線就宣稱掌握入侵範圍。~Coastal tides can drive periodic groundwater pressure with attenuation and phase delay inland. These signals inform hydraulic behavior but do not mean saltwater moves the same distance each cycle. A one-dimensional semi-infinite confined aquifer has an ideal periodic diffusion solution; boundaries, channels, pumping and atmospheric pressure introduce additional signals in practice. Understand amplitude ratios and phase dimensions, then compare multiple observations rather than treating a good fit at one well as proof of the saltwater-intrusion extent.',
'教學假設一維受壓半無限含水層，D=10000 m²/day、潮週期0.50 day；ω=2π/0.50，衰減長度δ=√(2D/ω)=39.894 m。在x=40 m，振幅比exp(−x/δ)=0.3669，相位延遲1.0027 rad。~For an ideal one-dimensional semi-infinite confined aquifer, diffusivity 10000 m²/day and period 0.50 day give angular frequency 2π/0.50 and attenuation length 39.894 m. At 40 m, amplitude ratio is 0.3669 and phase lag 1.0027 radians.',
'核對潮位與井壓時間戳及取樣頻率，以相同週期分量比較振幅和相位，避免把日平均資料拿來解半日潮。再檢查多個距離的衰減是否一致，並將抽水及大氣壓紀錄列為競爭解釋，確認擬合不是時間錯位造成。~Check tide and well-pressure timestamps and sampling frequency, comparing the same periodic component rather than applying daily averages to semidiurnal tides. Examine attenuation across multiple distances and consider pumping and atmospheric pressure as alternative explanations, verifying that apparent phase lag is not merely clock error.',
'不同儀器時鐘未同步，會產生假的相位延遲，進而扭曲推估的擴散率。即使壓力週期擬合良好，也不能省略鹽度監測，因為壓力訊號與溶質前緣屬於不同的物理過程。~Unsynchronized clocks create artificial phase lag and distort inferred diffusivity. Even a strong pressure-cycle fit cannot replace salinity monitoring, because hydraulic signals and solute fronts describe different physical processes and require distinct supporting observations.',
'地下水壓力呈現潮汐週期，就表示海水前緣每個週期都移動到相同的觀測位置。~A tidal pressure cycle proves that the seawater front reaches the observation location during every cycle.',
'把潮週期加倍，保持擴散率和距離不變，重算衰減長度、振幅比與相位。另加入十分鐘時鐘偏差，換算造成的相位誤差，說明資料同步與物理參數估計之間的關係，並區分壓力模型與鹽度驗證。~Double tidal period with diffusivity and distance fixed, recalculating attenuation length, amplitude ratio and phase. Add a ten-minute clock offset and convert it to phase error, explaining how synchronization affects inference while keeping hydraulic modeling distinct from salinity verification.'))
S=[source('usgs-fresh-salt-relations','美國地調所淡鹹水關係','USGS fresh and saltwater relations','USGS','https://www.usgs.gov/centers/new-york-water-science-center/science/long-island-fresh-and-saltwater-relationsinteractions','密度差、理想界面與分層入侵背景；數值為本課獨立假設。','Density contrast, ideal interfaces and layered intrusion context; numerical values are original teaching assumptions.'),source('itrc-la-barriers-case','洛杉磯海水屏障第一手案例','Los Angeles seawater-barrier firsthand case','ITRC / Water Replenishment District','https://mar-1.itrcweb.org/case-studies-3/','作者為WRD人員；核對1953、1964、1971建設年與機關分工，不引用現場操作值。','Written by a WRD practitioner; verifies construction milestones and agency roles, without transferring field operating settings.'),source('ocwd-barrier-history','橘郡水區屏障歷史','OCWD seawater-barrier history','Orange County Water District','https://www.ocwd.com/about/history/','1965年Alamitos首次由OCWD注入進口水，與1964年建設里程碑分開；1975年Talbert背景。','OCWD first imported-water injection at Alamitos in 1965 is distinct from the 1964 construction milestone; 1975 Talbert context.'),source('usgs-seawat4','密度耦合地下水模型SEAWAT第四版','SEAWAT version four density-coupled groundwater model','USGS','https://www.usgs.gov/publications/seawat-version-4-a-computer-program-simulation-multi-species-solute-and-heat-transport','2008年模型文件的密度耦合流動及傳輸範圍；不是現場設計認證。','Scope of density-coupled flow and transport in the 2008 documentation, not site-design certification.')]
save('b298',focus='密度水頭、補注屏障、分層監測與鹽度傳輸~Density heads, recharge barriers, layered monitoring and salinity transport',summary='以洛杉磯與橘郡海水屏障為背景，逐步區分壓力防護、淡鹹水混合與物質旅行時間。十個原創單元從尖銳界面近似、等效淡水水頭和達西流，深入徑向注入、線性疊加、注入能力與潮汐反應，所有算例均明列理想條件，並用分層觀測檢查解釋是否成立。~Using Los Angeles and Orange County barriers as context, distinguish hydraulic protection, fresh-saline mixing and material travel time. Ten original units progress from ideal interfaces and equivalent heads through radial injection, superposition, injectivity and tidal response, stating model assumptions and checking interpretations against depth-resolved observations.',history='南加州海水屏障把人工補注用於改善沿海地下水壓力，並需要持續監測鹽度。WRD人員撰寫的ITRC案例列出西海岸盆地屏障1953年、Alamitos屏障1964年及Dominguez屏障1971年的建設里程碑。橘郡水區另記錄1965年在Alamitos首次注入進口水，這是不同事件而不是日期矛盾。這些案例說明屏障是水力管理系統，需要水源、含水層與監測機關協作；本課不沿用現場注入設定，而以原創理想算例學習何時簡化有效、何時必須改用密度耦合分析。~Southern California barriers use managed recharge to influence coastal groundwater pressure while monitoring salinity. A WRD-authored ITRC case records construction milestones in 1953 for West Coast Basin, 1964 for Alamitos and 1971 for Dominguez. OCWD separately records its first imported-water injection at Alamitos in 1965, a different milestone rather than a contradictory date. The cases illustrate coordination of water supply, aquifer management and monitoring. Original idealized calculations explain useful simplifications and their limits without transferring field operating settings.',example='教學假設淡水與鹹水密度分別1000與1025 kg/m³，靜水尖銳界面模型將海面以上0.80 m水頭換算為海面以下32 m界面深度。這不是觀測到的鹽水前緣。另一個獨立算例把100 m路徑除以0.20 m/day孔隙速度，得到500日平流時間；同距離若水力擴散率100000 m²/day，特徵壓力尺度僅0.10日。兩者不能互換，快速水位反應不證明補注水已抵達。請改變密度差與儲水係數，分別重算各自影響的模型，並列出能否證實壓力、混合或水質改善的獨立觀測。~Assume fresh and saline densities of 1000 and 1025 kg/m³. An ideal hydrostatic sharp interface converts 0.80 m freshwater elevation above sea level into 32 m interface depth below it; this is not an observed salt front. In a separate calculation, a 100 m path and 0.20 m/day pore velocity imply 500 days of advective travel. Hydraulic diffusivity of 100000 m²/day gives a characteristic pressure scale of only 0.10 day at the same distance. These quantities are not interchangeable, and rapid head response does not prove recharge-water arrival. Vary density contrast and storativity separately, then identify independent evidence for pressure, mixing and quality improvement.',facts=['本課10個單元分開壓力傳播與物質傳輸。~The 10 units distinguish pressure propagation from material transport.','教學密度1000與1025 kg/m³產生四十倍靜水界面比例。~Teaching densities of 1000 and 1025 kg/m³ give a forty-to-one hydrostatic interface ratio.','教學徑向注入增量2.384 m依賴明列的定水頭外邊界。~The teaching 2.384 m radial buildup depends on the stated constant-head boundary.','教學混合比例約1.003%不等於水質合格判斷。~The teaching mixture fraction of about 1.003% is not a quality-acceptance judgment.','教學注入能力衰減80%仍需檢查原因。~The teaching 80% injectivity decline still requires causal investigation.','教學潮汐振幅比0.3669只描述理想壓力訊號。~The teaching tidal amplitude ratio 0.3669 describes only an ideal pressure signal.'],timeline=[{'year':'1953','event':'西海岸盆地屏障建設里程碑。~West Coast Basin barrier construction milestone.'},{'year':'1964','event':'Alamitos海水入侵屏障的建設里程碑。~Construction milestone for the Alamitos seawater intrusion barrier.'},{'year':'1965','event':'OCWD記錄在Alamitos首次注入進口水。~OCWD records first imported-water injection at Alamitos.'}],codes=['USGS SEAWAT Version 4：密度耦合流動傳輸模型參考。~USGS SEAWAT Version 4: density-coupled flow and transport reference.','ITRC人工補注案例：歷史、角色及監測背景。~ITRC managed recharge case: history, roles and monitoring context.'],landmarks=['西海岸盆地海水屏障~West Coast Basin seawater barrier','Alamitos海水屏障~Alamitos seawater barrier'],place={'name':'洛杉磯南灣沿海地區（概略）~Los Angeles South Bay coastal district (approximate)','country':'美國~United States','lat':33.85,'lng':-118.35,'query':'West Coast Basin Barrier Project California'},sources=S,vendors=[entity('洛杉磯郡公共工程部','Los Angeles County Public Works','https://dpw.lacounty.gov/','公共工程與水資源服務','Public works and water-resource services','ITRC案例所列海水屏障所有及運轉機關','Barrier owner and operator identified in the ITRC case'),entity('橘郡水區','Orange County Water District','https://www.ocwd.com/','地下水管理與補注','Groundwater management and replenishment','Alamitos歷史與區域地下水管理的官方來源','Official source for Alamitos history and regional groundwater management')],related=['b297','b300'],architectureNodes=[['密度與壓力基準','Density and pressure datum'],['補注與水頭隆起','Recharge and head buildup'],['分層流動與混合','Layered flow and mixing'],['監測與潮汐辨識','Monitoring and tidal diagnosis'],['成效與不確定度','Performance and uncertainty']],architectureEdges=[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[0,3]],units=U)
audit('b298',[('1000*.8/25',32,1e-9),('-20+201105/(1000*9.81)',.5,1e-9),('20*.002/.25',.16,1e-9),('500*math.log(20)/(2*math.pi*100)',2.384,.001),('1.5+1+.4',2.9,1e-9),('(240-50)/(19000-50)*100',1.003,.001),('(50-10)/50*100',80,1e-9),('100**2/(100/.001)',.1,1e-9),('300*100/(100+50)',200,1e-9),('math.exp(-40/math.sqrt(2*10000/(2*math.pi/.5)))',.3669,.0001)])
